1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,260
Man: So did you manage to get those tickets for the theater?

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:11,160
Woman: Yes, I got some great seats near the stage for Friday evening.

3
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:15,070
Man: That's fantastic. What play did you say it is?

4
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:19,080
Woman: It's a modern adaptation of Shakespeare's King Lear.

5
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,150
Man: Oh, that sounds interesting.

6
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:25,080
Woman: I think so too. I read King Lear in high school

7
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,660
but I've never seen it performed

8
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:31,220
and I find the idea of a modern adaptation really intriguing

9
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,170
I sure hope my sister does too.
